 Documentation/arch/sparc/oberon-msi.rst |  91 ++++
 arch/sparc/kernel/pci_fire.c            | 623 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 arch/sparc/kernel/pci_oberon_msi.h      |  50 ++
 4 files changed, 764 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/arch/sparc/oberon-msi.rst
